    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The width of a rectangle is <math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn></math> centimeters. The length of the rectangle is <math alttext=\"40\"><mn>40</mn></math> centimeters longer than the width. What is the area, in square centimeters, of this rectangle?</p>",
