    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The area of one of the bases of a right circular cylinder is <math alttext=\"81\"><mn>81</mn></math> square centimeters, and the volume of the cylinder is <math alttext=\"2,187\"><mn>2,187</mn></math> cubic centimeters. What is the height, in centimeters, of the cylinder?</p>",
